title: The German October
subtitle: Moscow decides that the German revolution is at hand.
new-page: true
tags: rf_event
view-if: year = 1923 and month >= 9
max-visits: 1
on-arrival: line = "insurrection"

= The German October

Moscow has watched the Cuno strikes closely. The leaders of the Russian party have concluded that Germany is ready for a Communist rising, and the International has called the <span class="p-kpd">KPD</span>'s leaders to Moscow. Military advisers, money and plans will follow. The date is to be set for the autumn.

Brandler warns that the party is not yet ready and that the left <span class="p-spd">SPD</span> will not follow. The Left says the opposite. Moscow's line is now insurrection.

- @embrace
- @doubts
- @refuse

@embrace
title: Throw everything into the preparations.
subtitle: Pleases Moscow, the <span class="f-left">Left</span> and <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann</span>. +2 funds, more readiness.
on-arrival: {!
Q.october_plan = 1;
window.RF.obey(Q, 8);
window.RF.lean(Q, {left: 4, right: -2});
Q.readiness += 6;
Q.funds += 2;
!}

Military advisers arrive from Russia. The party's military apparatus draws up lists of weapons and targets. Moscow's money flows.

@doubts
title: Accept, while warning Moscow that the party is not ready.
subtitle: Pleases the <span class="f-right">Right</span> and <span class="f-center">Middle Group</span>. +2 funds.
on-arrival: {!
Q.october_plan = 1;
window.RF.lean(Q, {right: 3, center: 2});
Q.moscow_trust += 2;
Q.autonomy -= 2;
Q.readiness += 4;
Q.funds += 2;
!}

You accept the plan and put your doubts on record. If it fails, the record may help, or may be used as proof that the leadership never believed in it.

@refuse
title: Refuse. The party is not ready, and a defeat will set it back years.
subtitle: Defies Moscow. Pleases the <span class="f-ultra">Ultra-Left</span>. Angers <span class="f-stalin">Thälmann</span> and the <span class="f-left">Left</span>. Moscow may impose the plan anyway.
on-arrival: {!
window.RF.defy(Q, 15);
window.RF.lean(Q, {left: -3});
Q.october_plan = 1;
if (Math.random() >= (100 - Q.autonomy) / 100) {
    Q.october_plan = 0;
}
!}

[? if october_plan = 0 : Against all expectations, the German party holds its ground. Moscow postpones the plan and makes clear it will not forget. ?][? if october_plan = 1 : Moscow overrules you. The plan goes ahead, and the German leadership will be expected to carry it out. ?]
